<p>You control dead matter around you, lying in the ground, decaying.</p><p>When you enter combat and every <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">35, 22, 17, 14, 13</acronym> turns thereafter a ghoul of level <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>character level 50">44, 46, 48, 50, 52</acronym> automatically raises to fight for you.</p><p>At level 3 you can forcefully activate this spell to summon up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> ghasts around you.</p><p>At level 5 every 4 summoned ghouls or ghasts a ghoulking is summoned for free.</p><p>Ghouls, ghasts and ghoulkings last for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 9, 10</acronym> turns.</p><p></p><p><span style="color: #7f7f7f"><span class="tstr-color-GREY"><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Ghoul minions come in larger numbers than skeleton minions but are generally more frail and disposable.</span></span></p><p></p>